  "id": "malariaatlas/evi",
  "title": "Enhanced Vegetation Index",
  "description": "Global gap-filled Enhanced Vegetation Index (EVI) rasters derived from MODIS MCD43D62, MCD43D63, and MCD43D64 v6.1 products at approximately 1 km and 5 km spatial resolution. EVI values are computed using the Huete et al. (2002) formula with cloud-cover artifacts removed via the Weiss et al. (2014) gap-filling method. Temporal coverage spans 8-daily, monthly, annual, and synoptic composites in GeoTIFF format.",
